    "ehb_faq_q9UdPc": {
      "type": "ehb-faq",
      "custom_css": [
        ".faq--more {display: none;}"
      ],
      "name": "EHB FAQ",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "",
        "block_bg": "",
        "title": "FAQ",
        "is_unfold": true,
        "product": "",
        "question_1": "<p><strong>What are the benefits of activating my membership?</strong></p>",
        "answer_1": "<p>1. Exclusive Double Discount<br/>Get a $200 OFF coupon (not stackable) plus a stackable $15 discount coupon upon activation.<br/>2. Expert-Level Product Care Guide<br/>Receive our exclusive 'Product Care' handbook via email. Filled with practical tips, it's designed to help you maintain your Jackery equipment in optimal condition.<br/>3. Post-Warranty Support Promise<br/>If any product issues arise within 3 months after your extended warranty ends, we will provide a 15% OFF coupon as a gesture of goodwill. Simply contact our customer service team to apply.</p>",
        "question_2": "<p><strong>What are the rules of the coupons sent by registration？</strong></p>",
        "answer_2": "<p>1. The $200 coupon<br/>The coupon applies to all full-priced items on the US site, excluding new arrivals and refurbished products. Please note, it can’t be combined with any existing discounts during the Jackery Sale—only regular-priced products are eligible.The minimum spend required is $1,200 USD. To redeem, simply enter both the coupon code and your registered email address at checkout. Please note that this discount coupon is valid for 30 days from the date of issuance. For complete instructions, please refer to the email we sent you.<br/>2. The $15 stackable coupon<br/>You can use the $15 stackable discount together with already discounted items during the Jackery Sale. However, it can’t be combined with other stackable coupons. This coupon is valid for all products except new arrivals, refurbished items and cable-type accessories. This coupon can only be used on the US site. The minimum spend required is $150 USD. To redeem it, please make sure to copy and paste both the coupon code and your email address at checkout. Please note that this discount coupon is valid for 30 days from the date of issuance. For full details, please check your email.</p>",
        "question_3": "<p><strong>What are the rules of the gift card sent by SMS subscription?</strong></p>",
        "answer_3": "<p>By subscribing to Jackery with your phone number, you will receive a FREE $20 gift card and our latest news and deals via text message.<br/>The gift card applies to all products and does not require a minimum order value. It is valid for 30 days from the date of issue. For more details, please refer to your email.</p>",
        "question_4": "<p><strong>What about the warranty extension period?</strong></p>",
        "answer_4": "<p>The warranty extension period is subject to the details found on each product page.</p>",
        "question_5": "<p><strong>Where can I check my warranty extension information?</strong></p>",
        "answer_5": "<p>If you purchase from Jackery's official website, you can log in to check your extended warranty information via My Account - My Device. If you purchase from other channels, please refer to your email for information about your extended warranty.</p>",
        "question_6": "<p><strong>I purchased Jackery products from an offline store, and there is no Jackery official website in my country. Can I apply for an extended warranty?</strong></p>",
        "answer_6": "<p>Yes, you can apply for an extended warranty for your products via any of Jackery's official websites. However, the coupon obtained by activating your membership is site-specific (i.e., it can only be used for orders on that site, and delivery of orders is limited to its coverage areas.) For more details, please refer to the site where you activate your membership.</p>",
        "question_7": "<p><strong>Can multiple products in the same order be extended at the same time?</strong></p>",
        "answer_7": "<p>Yes, when you purchase Jackery products online, you only need to enter the order number. The warranty of all products included in the order will be extended.</p>",
        "question_8": "<p><strong>What should customers who buy Jackery products from offline stores pay attention to?</strong></p>",
        "answer_8": "<p>1) You should submit the SN number and receipt which includes the product name, store and order time. Otherwise, it may be returned. After the submission, the team will review it and notify you via email. If you choose to activate your membership, the coupon will be sent to you by email after the warranty extension is approved.<br/>2) Submit the SN number of your orders which can be uploaded in batches by naming them SN1,SN2; etc.</p>",
        "question_9": "<p><strong>Can I apply for an extended warranty right after I place an order on third-party online channel?</strong></p>",
        "answer_9": "<p>No. Only shipped orders can successfully apply for the extended warranty.</p>",
